          "id": 202470000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1304,
          "text": "Suspected shipwreck SOS detected: After detecting danger, Aventurine called emergency services from this approximate location. You are receiving this message because you are currently the closest emergency contact to Aventurine in his contacts.",
